OL,4,CCentrica boss 'hugely concerned' over  
OL,5,Cimpact of soaring energy bills         
OL,6,GThe boss of British Gas owner Centrica 
OL,7,Gsays he is "hugely concerned" about    
OL,8,Gthe impact the expected jump in energy 
OL,9,Gbills in January will have on          
OL,10,Gconsumers.                             
OL,12,FChris O'Shea told the BBC he thought   
OL,13,Fthe number of people unable or         
OL,14,Funwilling to pay their energy bills    
OL,15,Fwould rise when prices go up in the    
OL,16,Fnew year.                              
OL,18,FThe new energy price cap to take       
OL,19,Feffect from January will be announced  
OL,20,Fon Wednesday and consultancy Cornwall  
OL,21,FInsight has forecast it will jump by   
OL,22,F#443 a year for a typical household.   
